        {
          "id": 1074893334,
          "type": "DiffNote",
          "body": "I would like to change the value here:  \n`        guint64 lengths[3] = { ciphertext_len, is_v12 ? 13 : 0, auth_tag_len };`  \n  \nChanging the `0` to `5` fixes the issue but I don't know how much pre-draft 25 traffic is out there.  \n  \nThe flow of setting the values (`gcry_cipher_ctl()`) then checking them later (`gcry_cipher_authenticate`) is laid out in #18277.",
          "author": {
            "id": 6701257,
            "username": "chuckcraft",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "Chuck Craft",
            "state": "active",
